.TH ZERODDS-GRPC-BRIDGED 1 "2026-05-06" "1.0.0-rc.1" "ZeroDDS Manual"
.SH NAME
zerodds-grpc-bridged \- DDS to gRPC bridge daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zerodds-grpc-bridged
[\fB\-c\fR \fIFILE\fR]
[\fB\-\-validate\-only\fR]
[\fB\-V\fR | \fB\-h\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B zerodds-grpc-bridged
exposes DDS topics as bidirectional-streaming gRPC services. Supports
TLS and mTLS, gRPC-reflection, deadline propagation, retry-policies and
zero-copy XCDR2 transport. Implements
.IR zerodds-grpc-bridge-1.0 (7).
.SH OPTIONS
.BR \-c , \-\-log\-level , \-\-validate\-only , \-V , \-h .
.SH SIGNALS
SIGTERM, SIGHUP.
.SH FILES
.I /etc/zerodds/grpc-bridged.yaml .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR zerodds-grpc-bridged.yaml (5),
.BR grpcurl (1).
.SH AUTHORS
ZeroDDS Contributors.
